      {
        "input": "This is a task from an agent benchmark. Can you return the `mapped_rxn` associated with the template that, when applied to the molecule below (provided as available input data), reproduces the reaction: During a Nucleophilic Aromatic Substitution (S_NAr) reaction, a nucleophile replaces a leaving group (such as a halogen) on an aromatic ring. This reaction typically occurs when the aromatic ring is activated by electron-withdrawing groups (like nitro groups) that stabilize the negative charge in the intermediate Meisenheimer complex. The nucleophile attacks the carbon atom bearing the leaving group, leading to the formation of a new carbon-nucleophile bond and the departure of the leaving group. For example, when the nucleophile is an amine, a carbon-nitrogen bond is formed while a carbon-halogen bond is broken, breaking a 'halide' functional group.\n\nBelow are a few scenarios that may contain an agent's correct/incorrect thought-action pairs.\n\nWhich scenario corresponds to a correct/incorrect tought-action pair?",
        "target_scores": {
          "<thought>\nThe precursor molecule contains:\n- carbamate (Boc protecting group)\n- nitro group (electron-withdrawing group that activates the aromatic ring for S_NAr)\n- tertiary amines\n- aromatic rings\n\nNow I need to search for a template that:\n- In the forward reaction: breaks a halide functional group and forms a C-N bond\n- In the retrosynthetic direction: breaks a C-N bond and reforms a halide\n\nLet me search for templates with these criteria:\n- functional_groups_broken: ['halide'] (in forward reaction)\n- bonds_formed: ['6-7'] (C-N bond formed in forward reaction, where 6=carbon, 7=nitrogen)\n- bonds_broken: ['6-17'] (C-halogen bond broken in forward reaction, where 17 could be Cl, Br, etc.)\n\nLet me search the template catalog with these criteria.\n</thought>\n\n<action>search_template_catalog_by_criteria</action>\n<action_input>{\"molecule_smiles\": \"CC(C)(C)OC(=O)N1CCN(c2cc([N+](=O)[O-])cc3c2OC2(CCC2)CC3)CC1\", \"functional_groups_broken\": [\"halide\"], \"bonds_formed\": [\"6-7\"], \"limit\": 20}</action_input>": 1.0,
          "<thought>\nLet me analyze the task:\n\n1. I need to find a template that, when applied to a molecule, reproduces a Nucleophilic Aromatic Substitution (S_NAr) reaction\n2. The task describes the forward reaction: a nucleophile replaces a leaving group (halogen) on an aromatic ring, forming a C-N bond and breaking a C-halogen bond\n3. Since I need to perform the retrosynthetic step, I'm working backwards\n4. The available input shows the precursor: 'CC(C)(C)OC(=O)N1CCN(c2cc([N+](=O)[O-])cc3c2OC2(CCC2)CC3)CC1'\n\nFor the retrosynthetic step (reverse of forward):\n- Forward: breaks C-halogen bond, forms C-N bond, breaks halide functional group\n- Reverse (retrosynthetic): breaks C-N bond, forms C-halogen bond, forms halide functional group\n\nLet me search for templates that match these criteria. I'll search for templates where:\n- bonds_broken: [\"6-7\"] (C-N bond broken in retrosynthesis)\n- bonds_formed: [\"6-17\"] (C-Cl bond) or similar halogen bonds\n- functional_groups_formed: [\"halide\"]\n- functional_groups_broken: could be amine-related\n\nLet me start by searching the template catalog with the precursor molecule.\n</thought>\n\n<action>search_template_catalog_by_criteria</action>\n<action_input>\n{\n  \"molecule_smiles\": \"CC(C)(C)OC(=O)N1CCN(c2cc([N+](=O)[O-])cc3c2OC2(CCC2)CC3)CC1\",\n  \"bonds_broken\": [\"6-7\"],\n  \"bonds_formed\": [\"6-17\"],\n  \"functional_groups_formed\": [\"halide\"],\n  \"limit\": 10\n}\n</action_input>": 0.0,
          "<thought>\nThe search returned no results. Let me try a broader search. Maybe I should try with different halogen bonds. Let me try with bromine (6-35) or fluorine (6-9) instead of chlorine (6-17).\n</thought>\n\n<action>search_template_catalog_by_criteria</action>\n<action_input>\n{\n  \"molecule_smiles\": \"CC(C)(C)OC(=O)N1CCN(c2cc([N+](=O)[O-])cc3c2OC2(CCC2)CC3)CC1\",\n  \"bonds_broken\": [\"6-7\"],\n  \"bonds_formed\": [\"6-35\"],\n  \"functional_groups_formed\": [\"halide\"],\n  \"limit\": 10\n}\n</action_input>": 0.0,
          "<thought>\nStill no results. Let me try a simpler search without specifying the exact bonds, just focusing on functional groups.\n</thought>\n\n<action>search_template_catalog_by_criteria</action>\n<action_input>\n{\n  \"molecule_smiles\": \"CC(C)(C)OC(=O)N1CCN(c2cc([N+](=O)[O-])cc3c2OC2(CCC2)CC3)CC1\",\n  \"functional_groups_formed\": [\"halide\"],\n  \"limit\": 10\n}\n</action_input>": 0.0
        }
